      "translation": "They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival?",
      "transliteration": "Yas'aloonaka 'anis saa'ati ayyaana mursaahaa",
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5755,
      "numberInSurah": 43,
      "arabic": "فِيمَ أَنتَ مِن ذِكْرَىٰهَآ",
      "translation": "In what [position] are you that you should mention it?",
      "transliteration": "Feema anta min zikraahaa",
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5756,
      "numberInSurah": 44,
      "arabic": "إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ مُنتَهَىٰهَآ",
      "translation": "To your Lord is its finality.",
      "transliteration": "Ilaa Rabbika muntahaa haa",
      "juz": 30,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 584,
      "ruku": 521,
      "hizbQuarter": 233,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5757,
      "numberInSurah": 45,
      "arabic": "إِنَّمَآ أَنتَ مُنذِرُ مَن يَخْشَىٰهَا",
      "translation": "You are only a warner for those who fear it.",
